flowchart TD
    subgraph NOW["Now: Paper 1's only target is first tested after your decision"]
        direction LR
        N1["M1 to M4<br/>tune and freeze on<br/>2 MNIST digits and SDXL pairs"] --> N2{"Your go or no-go<br/>D4"} --> N3["E1 and E2<br/>first CLEVR run<br/>target: 7 objects"]
